// paid for before a call was made. A reply that came back in the
// wrong shape says nothing about any of them. Raising here would
// abandon the pass at its last group and lose the results every other
// candidate in the batch produced, after the calls were made and
// charged. So the item goes on carrying its refusal, the statement
// below writes neither half, and the pool row stands exactly as it
// did: approved, open, and at the head of the next pass.
