// offered set, which nothing downstream undoes and nothing reports.
// The answer this node will read at all. The same ceiling
// src/lib/chunk.ts puts on the text a call was made from, and the
// same number ar-ingest's own answer reader uses: research about a
// candidate cannot honestly be longer than the corpus it was read
// out of. What it bounds is the string handed to a parser, which is
// the one unbounded thing on this item.
